                                "sense_id": "6c21aed9-1886-338d-8a49-d4c4b8d033f7",
                                "text": "He had become increasingly petty, irritated by details, by the diminishing, for example, of their forenames—Bill, Bert, Mike, Geoff, Steve. He wanted to inquire peevishly if a commitment to Marxism was incompatible with a disyllabic forename."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad02f87a-8c1c-48af-8454-c3aafc351b80",
                                "sense_id": "6c21aed9-1886-338d-8a49-d4c4b8d033f7",
                                "text": "The place in Malibu belongs to my husband, Geoff. He's a G-E-O-F-F Geoff, not the J-E-F-F kind."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
